<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FORE Systems downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FORE Systems downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim said it downgraded FORE Systems Inc to &quot;perform in line&quot; from &quot;outperform significantly.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1-1/2 to 11-1/2.</p>
</text>
